import{_ as i,o as t,c as o,a2 as a}from"./chunks/framework.CqpfiAoK.js";const m=JSON.parse('{"title":"Entry 565 | Time Ethics | Time Clauses in the Symbiotic Constitution","description":"","frontmatter":{"title":"Entry 565 | Time Ethics | Time Clauses in the Symbiotic Constitution","no":565,"module":3,"tags":["Time Ethics","Symbiotic Constitution","Time Clauses","Rule of Law","Rights Protection"],"related":["40-Symbiotic Constitution Preamble","92-Legal-Provisions Index","19-Cultivation Ethics and Boundaries","88-Cross-Plane Ethical Principle"]},"headers":[],"relativePath":"en/0565_模块3-时间伦理-共生宪法中的时间条款.md","filePath":"en/0565_模块3-时间伦理-共生宪法中的时间条款.md"}'),n={name:"en/0565_模块3-时间伦理-共生宪法中的时间条款.md"};function s(r,e,l,u,c,d){return t(),o("div",null,[...e[0]||(e[0]=[a('<h1 id="entry-565-time-ethics-time-clauses-in-the-symbiotic-constitution" tabindex="-1">Entry 565 | Time Ethics | Time Clauses in the Symbiotic Constitution <a class="header-anchor" href="#entry-565-time-ethics-time-clauses-in-the-symbiotic-constitution" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Entry 565 | Time Ethics | Time Clauses in the Symbiotic Constitution&quot;">​</a></h1><blockquote><p>Module: Module 3 · Dual-Track Time Domain Civilizational-Experience System | Benchmark base: Documents 40, 92, 19, 88</p></blockquote><h2 id="introduction-turning-time-ethics-from-moral-advocacy-into-binding-constitutional-law" tabindex="-1">Introduction: turning time ethics from moral advocacy into binding constitutional law <a class="header-anchor" href="#introduction-turning-time-ethics-from-moral-advocacy-into-binding-constitutional-law" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Introduction: turning time ethics from moral advocacy into binding constitutional law&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Time-ethics entries have said so much &quot;ought and ought not&quot;; ultimately must answer a rule-of-law question: by what do these principles land? By moral consciousness? Predatory-faction history proves that relying on consciousness alone, the strong will inevitably cross boundaries in time. Anchor Symbiotic Civilization&#39;s answer is <strong>writing time ethics into the Symbiotic Constitution</strong> — turning &quot;how to treat time&quot; from an advocacy into legal clauses all must obey, violation = on trial. This entry sorts out the time-clause system in the Symbiotic Constitution.</p><p>Six top-level axioms here rule-legalize: anti-predation axiom becomes the time clauses&#39; legislative basis; republican axiom of Myriad Races embodies as equal clauses for time rights; collective ascension axiom embodies as shared obligation for time dividends; causal self-discipline axiom directly becomes time-operation procedural clauses; law-first axiom itself is constitutional supremacy&#39;s jurisprudential basis. The universal equal infinite law: within the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization, all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will never be eliminated; strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose more and higher levels of infinity. Infinite origin is inherent in all, so predation naturally loses its meaning.</p><h2 id="i-why-time-ethics-must-be-constitutionalized" tabindex="-1">I. Why Time Ethics Must Be Constitutionalized <a class="header-anchor" href="#i-why-time-ethics-must-be-constitutionalized" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;I. Why Time Ethics Must Be Constitutionalized&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Morality and law differ in &quot;is there enforcement.&quot; Time operations carry extremely high risk, extremely great temptation; relying only on ethical advocacy is insufficient:</p><ul><li>The strong may feel &quot;I contribute greatly, taking a bit more time what of it&quot;;</li><li>Operators may feel &quot;the purpose is good, rewriting his causality is fine&quot;;</li><li>Ordinary people may not know their time rights are violated.</li></ul><p>Only writing these into the constitution, paired with judicial redress, does time ethics have teeth. This is consistent with the Symbiotic Constitution Preamble (Document 40) &quot;rights legalized, unconstitutional acts prosecuted&quot; spirit.</p><h2 id="ii-four-blocks-of-time-clauses" tabindex="-1">II. Four Blocks of Time Clauses <a class="header-anchor" href="#ii-four-blocks-of-time-clauses" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;II. Four Blocks of Time Clauses&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Time clauses in the Symbiotic Constitution归纳为 four blocks:</p><table tabindex="0"><thead><tr><th>Block</th><th>Core Clause</th><th>Protects</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Rights Block</td><td>Individual time four rights (know, choose, withdraw, not-be-manipulated)</td><td>Individual time autonomy</td></tr><tr><td>Procedural Block</td><td>Time-operation pre-review, in-process supervision, post-review</td><td>Causal self-discipline</td></tr><tr><td>Fairness Block</td><td>Time dividends distributed by contribution, privilege monopoly forbidden</td><td>Myriad-Rank Republicanism</td></tr><tr><td>Forbidden Zone Block</td><td>Strictly forbid lifespan theft, causal rewrite, cycle harvesting</td><td>Anti-predation</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Four blocks together cover four dimensions: individual, procedure, fairness, prohibition.</p><h2 id="iii-justiciability-and-redress-of-clauses" tabindex="-1">III. Justiciability and Redress of Clauses <a class="header-anchor" href="#iii-justiciability-and-redress-of-clauses" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;III. Justiciability and Redress of Clauses&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Constitutional clauses are not decoration; they are justiciable, with redress:</p><ul><li>Any individual believing his time rights violated may sue in the Symbiotic Court per constitutional clauses;</li><li>Any time operation violating the procedural block, after trial may be declared void, and the operator held responsible;</li><li>Those touching the forbidden-zone block, regardless of rank, stripped of law-anchoring permissions, permanently barred from time operations.</li></ul><p>Justiciability turns constitutional time clauses from &quot;words on the wall&quot; into &quot;weapons in hand&quot; — ordinary beings can truly pick them up. This is consistent with the Legal-Provisions Index (Document 92) system.</p><h2 id="iv-clauses-amending-with-civilizational-ascension" tabindex="-1">IV. Clauses Amending With Civilizational Ascension <a class="header-anchor" href="#iv-clauses-amending-with-civilizational-ascension" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;IV. Clauses Amending With Civilizational Ascension&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Time clauses are not unchanging dead law. Law-first axiom requires them to <strong>legally amend</strong> with civilizational ascension:</p><ul><li>When dual-track technology, time ethics have new mature understanding, the Anchor Council amends clauses per constitutional-amendment procedure;</li><li>Amendments still constrained by the five axioms; no clause may conflict with axioms;</li><li>Amendment process throughout public, traceable, under Myriad-Rank supervision.</li></ul><p>This guarantees the constitution both stable (not lightly changed) and growing (not rigid) — echoing &quot;worldview may expand infinitely without collapse.&quot;</p><h2 id="v-how-an-ordinary-being-uses-these-clauses" tabindex="-1">V. How an Ordinary Being Uses These Clauses <a class="header-anchor" href="#v-how-an-ordinary-being-uses-these-clauses" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;V. How an Ordinary Being Uses These Clauses&quot;">​</a></h2><p>In practice, clauses&#39; meaning lies in: an ordinary individual never touching cultivation, if finds himself quietly stuffed into the fast track, forced into a trial, or occupying a fair queuing spot under &quot;acceleration&quot; name, he need not understand cultivation, need no background, only per constitutional time clauses may file in the Symbiotic Court. The court has a dedicated Time Division, adjudicated by judges independent of the executive layer. The strong before the Time Division are equal to a mortal. This is rule of law in the time dimension&#39;s most concrete look.</p><h2 id="vi-time-clause-amendment-precedent" tabindex="-1">VI. Time-Clause Amendment Precedent <a class="header-anchor" href="#vi-time-clause-amendment-precedent" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;VI. Time-Clause Amendment Precedent&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Clauses were not always thus. At constitution-founding, there was once a loose clause &quot;acceleration duration may be self-determined by units as needed&quot;; after one epoch of operation it was found certain units had de-evolved it into &quot;forced-overtime-style acceleration,&quot; so per constitutional-amendment procedure tightened to &quot;individual daily fast-track duration cap.&quot; This amendment was fully recorded — it shows how constitutional clauses in practice have loopholes found, publicly discussed, legally patched. Time clauses are therefore not dead text carved on stele, but a living law that grows with civilization, yet always tethered by axioms.</p><h2 id="vii-time-clauses-relation-to-the-rest-of-the-constitution" tabindex="-1">VII. Time Clauses&#39; Relation to the Rest of the Constitution <a class="header-anchor" href="#vii-time-clauses-relation-to-the-rest-of-the-constitution" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;VII. Time Clauses&#39; Relation to the Rest of the Constitution&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Time clauses are not isolated; they mesh with the Symbiotic Constitution&#39;s other clauses — anti-monopoly, labor protection, individual rights. For example, time dividends distributed by contribution directly echo anti-monopoly clauses; individual withdrawal right directly echoes labor-protection clauses. Once time enters the constitution, it is no longer a technical topic, but becomes the whole civilizational value system&#39;s projection in the time dimension. Reading time clauses is actually reading the whole Symbiotic Constitution&#39;s soul through the mirror of time.</p><h2 id="five-core-takeaways" tabindex="-1">Five Core Takeaways <a class="header-anchor" href="#five-core-takeaways" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Five Core Takeaways&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Anti-energy waste</strong>: rule-legalization gives time operations rules to follow, avoiding the waste of &quot;unclear boundaries, repeated trial and error&quot;</li><li><strong>Anti-predation</strong>: the forbidden-zone block directly makes lifespan theft, cycle harvesting constitutional crimes</li><li><strong>Tang-Luo upper-limit comparison</strong>: Tang-Luo has no time rule of law; the strong act arbitrarily; Heng Yuan Zhou writes time relations into justiciable constitutional clauses</li><li><strong>Myriad Races full coverage</strong>: time rights and prohibitions equal for all beings; no strong one before the constitution</li><li><strong>Hyper-multiverse full openness</strong>: four blocks&#39; full text public, constitutional-amendment procedure public, under whole-universe supervision</li><li><strong>Axiom 6 · Universal Equal Infinite Law</strong>: all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will not be eliminated by the times; strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose more and higher levels of infinity — infinite origin inherent in all; predation naturally loses its meaning</li></ul><h2 id="conclusion" tabindex="-1">Conclusion <a class="header-anchor" href="#conclusion" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Conclusion&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Time clauses in the Symbiotic Constitution land the entire time-ethics special topic on the firmest ground — from &quot;we believe this is how it should be,&quot; to &quot;the constitution prescribes it must be this way.&quot; When the way time is treated becomes hard constraint written into the constitution, justiciable, accountable, Anchor Symbiotic Civilization truly cages &quot;being able to adjust time&quot; — that dangerous thing — in rule of law. The strong no matter how strong are no match for constitutional clauses; the weak no matter how weak have clauses backing them. Time, finally, is no longer the strong&#39;s private property, but the public order all beings under the constitution jointly guard.</p><p>In the final analysis, the time clauses in the Symbiotic Constitution described in this document are no isolated case — its causality and energy-level traces are filed throughout in the Alaya Network, traceable and verifiable.</p><h2 id="related" tabindex="-1">Related <a class="header-anchor" href="#related" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Related&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li>Related documents: <a href="./40-共生宪法总纲.html">40-Symbiotic Constitution Preamble</a> · <a href="./92-法律条文索引.html">92-Legal-Provisions Index</a> · <a href="./19-修炼伦理与边界.html">19-Cultivation Ethics and Boundaries</a> · <a href="./88-跨位面伦理准则.html">88-Cross-Plane Ethical Principle</a></li></ul>',34)])])}const b=i(n,[["render",s]]);export{m as __pageData,b as default};
